{
  "source": "Prompts/ai-agents-3.mp4",
  "duration": 161.053625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.46,
      "text": "Unlike standard chatbots like chatgbt or Claude that primarily generate text to answer questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.94,
      "end": 13.32,
      "text": "an AI agent is a computer program that takes independent action to finish a specific job for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.9,
      "end": 15.78,
      "text": "Take this exact video course for example."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.42,
      "end": 23.02,
      "text": "We wanted a clean, custom layout for the lessons, but neither of us actually knows how to write the code to build one."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.6,
      "end": 27.36,
      "text": "So we used the built-in coding agents in chatgbt and Claude."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.88,
      "end": 32.56,
      "text": "Instead of struggling with syntax, we just described the layout we wanted in plain English."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.3,
      "end": 34.46,
      "text": "The agent took it from there."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 39.2,
      "text": "It dug through our folders, found the right file, rewrote the underlying code,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.46,
      "end": 41.78,
      "text": "and then ran a test to make sure the layout didn't break."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.5,
      "end": 44.92,
      "text": "But it didn't publish it completely on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.52,
      "end": 50.48,
      "text": "We still had to review the final lesson closely to ensure the changes worked exactly as intended,"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.82,
      "end": 54.16,
      "text": "and more importantly, that it would be easy for our students to follow."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.8,
      "end": 55.82,
      "text": "We were still the editors."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.54,
      "end": 59.04,
      "text": "Writing code is just one specific use case."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.92,
      "end": 64.4,
      "text": "Across dozens of different industries, tasks that used to require manual human effort"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.4,
      "end": 66.14,
      "text": "are being handed off to these agents."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.06,
      "end": 68.44,
      "text": "See current agent capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.62,
      "end": 72.48,
      "text": "Software agents automatically write, test, and fix code."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.32,
      "end": 76.28,
      "text": "Research agents compare product prices across sites for sales."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.34,
      "end": 80.78,
      "text": "Customer service agents independently track packages and deliver updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.92,
      "end": 84.9,
      "text": "Office agents update sales spreadsheets and format meeting slides."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.47,
      "end": 90.06,
      "text": "In all of these fields, the software is taking large volumes of routine,"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.56,
      "end": 93.56,
      "text": "time-consuming busy work, completely off people's plates."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.82,
      "end": 98.76,
      "text": "But stripping away all that busy work naturally raises a massive question."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.46,
      "end": 102.02,
      "text": "If agents can do much of the work that makes up a job,"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.58,
      "end": 104.9,
      "text": "what happens to the people doing that job today?"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.84,
      "end": 108.76,
      "text": "To figure out where the human fits into this new workflow,"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.12,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "we first need to look under the hood and understand exactly how these programs"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 115.68,
      "text": "operate without us having to click every single button."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.2,
      "end": 119.84,
      "text": "So how does an agent actually do the work once you hand it off?"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.38,
      "end": 122.6,
      "text": "It follows a very strict mechanical loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.08,
      "end": 124.62,
      "text": "This flowchart maps the four steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.3,
      "end": 126.34,
      "text": "First, set the goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.78,
      "end": 128.22,
      "text": "Second, plan the steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.02,
      "end": 130.46,
      "text": "Third, act using a tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.24,
      "end": 132.18,
      "text": "Fourth, check the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.7,
      "end": 134.66,
      "text": "If it fails, it loops back automatically."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.38,
      "end": 136.3,
      "text": "But there are limits."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.96,
      "end": 140.08,
      "text": "The agent functions only within the boundaries you construct for it."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.08,
      "end": 142.98,
      "text": "The agent can finish, retry, or ask for help."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.62,
      "end": 145.18,
      "text": "You set goals and judge results."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.84,
      "end": 147.86,
      "text": "Agents do the work, but the name on it is yours."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.68,
      "end": 150.62,
      "text": "This is the new dynamic of digital labor."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.22,
      "end": 154.46,
      "text": "You delegate the tasks but retain responsibility for the final product."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.92,
      "end": 155.4,
      "text": "You ask."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.74,
      "end": 156.22,
      "text": "It acts."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.72,
      "end": 157.38,
      "text": "You make it better."
    }
  ],
